  "description": "Absolute Garbage is a greatest hits album by American rock band Garbage. It was released worldwide on July 23, 2007, through Warner Music imprint A&E Records with a North American release through Almo Sounds, Geffen Records, and Universal Music Enterprises the following day. The compilation was issued while the band was on hiatus following a one-off reformation to perform at a benefit concert early in the year.",
